5,1,1,talk,Minako,,"We should start by getting a clear picture of the actual costs. I'll look into last year's tax, insurance and parking papers, as well as last year's fuel receipts.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,I think it's wise to look at the human element as well. I'll check what two other car-sharing households said and the spell of checking each other's figures.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Asuka,,I want to understand the actual condition and reliability of the vehicle. I'll look into the state of the car at handover and the mechanic's remarks at the last service.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shion,,I'll take a look at the hours of use recorded in the diary and the month's trial of recording every run. We need a logical basis for how we split the costs.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I think it would be helpful to see the time spent. I'll look into the trips that repeat weekly and the hours of use recorded in the diary.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Minako,,"I think we have a good spread of data points. By combining the financial records with the usage logs, we can see if the current split is actually fair.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"Indeed. While the numbers provide a skeleton, the social dynamics provide the flesh. I'm curious to see if the friction is purely mathematical or something more... atmospheric.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"Regardless of the atmosphere, the physical state of the car is a practical necessity. If the vehicle isn't reliable or ready for use, the cost-splitting becomes a secondary issue.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shion,,"Practicality is fine, Asuka, but it's a waste of time to discuss maintenance if we can't even agree on who is paying for it. We need hard data on usage first.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I agree that data is important. I just hope we can find a way to make it easier for everyone, so no one feels too stressed about it.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Minako,,"Let's keep the focus on the facts for now. Once we have the results from our research, we can address the stress and the atmosphere with a concrete plan.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"A concrete plan is a lovely goal, Minako. I simply hope we don't build a perfectly logical structure on a foundation of unspoken resentment. It would be a shame for the math to be right and the mood to be wrong.","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"Resentment often stems from a lack of reliability. If the car is consistently unavailable or poorly maintained, no amount of mathematical fairness will solve the frustration of a failed morning commute.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shion,,"You're focusing on the symptoms, Asuka. The real source of frustration is the ambiguity of the payments. If we don't know the actual figures, we're just guessing who is being unfair.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I think everyone has a point. I just worry that even with the figures, the process of sorting it all out every time is... a bit much. I'll just wait for the results.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Minako,,I agree with Daisuke that the process shouldn't be overly burdensome. Let's gather the information first and then find a sustainable system.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
21,1,4,pass,Minako,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,I concur. Let us see what the records reveal and hope they provide a map that leads us toward both financial clarity and social harmony.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
23,1,4,pass,Benjamin,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,1,4,talk,Asuka,,I agree. Let's see what the data shows. I'll be interested to see if the maintenance records reflect the issues I've noticed.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
25,1,4,pass,Asuka,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,1,4,talk,Shion,,Let's stop speculating and get to the numbers. I'm looking forward to seeing how the actual usage aligns with our assumptions.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
27,1,4,pass,Shion,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
28,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,I... I hope the results help us. I'll just do my best to help however I can.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
